{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05758","headline":"家叔徵君东溪草堂二首 二 · 卢象","name":"家叔徵君东溪草堂二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今朝共游者，得性闲未归。\n已到仙人家，莫惊鸥鸟飞。\n水深严子钓，松挂巢父衣。\n云气转幽寂，溪流无是非。\n名理未足羡，腥臊讵所希。\n自惟负贞意，何岁当食薇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}